WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Quality modernization and AI
adoption should progress together.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.080
Trusted work establishes clear
scenarios and expected outcomes.

00:00:08.183 --> 00:00:13.120
Repeatable execution adds reliable
suites, isolated data and controlled

00:00:13.175 --> 00:00:17.280
dependencies. Shared services
make those assets reusable.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.520
Broader AI execution then adds
bounded tools and tested recovery.

00:00:21.573 --> 00:00:25.120
Reviewed assistance can begin
while foundations improve.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:28.400
The evidence required becomes
stronger as the system

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:31.760
takes on more execution
and a wider operating scope.
